{"n": 376, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "376.webp", "text": "A)\n\n24-101\n\n2400006 ADJUSTING SELECTOR LEVER, ACCELERATOR\nLINKAGE AND THROTTLE CABLE\n\nAdjusting Selector Lever:\n\nVersion with Linkage:\n\nCheck tightness of console before making adjustments.\nDisconnect selector rod (1) on selector lever lower section (2).\nEngage selector lever (3) on transmission in position N..\n\nPress selector lever (4) against stop (5) on shift gate.\n\nKeep changing length of selector rod (1) until pin (6) is aligned with bore in selector lever lower section (2).\n\nNow shorten length pf selector rod by 1 turn with pin (6).\nConnect and secure selector rod.", "words": [["A)", 0.0704, 0.8183, 0.0821, 0.8336], ["24-101", 0.4514, 0.0292, 0.5218, 0.0564], ["2400006", 0.266, 0.0656, 0.3161, 0.0776], ["ADJUSTING", 0.3288, 0.065, 0.3921, 0.0769], ["SELECTOR", 0.3951, 0.065, 0.4539, 0.0776], ["LEVER,", 0.4585, 0.065, 0.4995, 0.0782], ["ACCELERATOR", 0.502, 0.0643, 0.5871, 0.0769], ["LINKAGE", 0.3293, 0.0816, 0.3794, 0.0935], ["AND", 0.3835, 0.0816, 0.4078, 0.0928], ["THROTTLE", 0.4108, 0.0809, 0.4716, 0.0935], ["CABLE", 0.4752, 0.0809, 0.5117, 0.0928], ["Adjusting", 0.0927, 0.8183, 0.1398, 0.8382], ["Selector", 0.1434, 0.8183, 0.1814, 0.8382], ["Lever:", 0.1864, 0.8183, 0.2153, 0.8382], ["Version", 0.0947, 0.8369, 0.2001, 0.8508], ["with", 0.1342, 0.8342, 0.154, 0.8534], ["Linkage:", 0.1586, 0.8369, 0.2001, 0.8508], ["Check", 0.0927, 0.8501, 0.1206, 0.87], ["tightness", 0.1256, 0.8501, 0.1677, 0.87], ["of", 0.1722, 0.8501, 0.1814, 0.87], ["console", 0.1864, 0.8501, 0.2209, 0.87], ["before", 0.2254, 0.8501, 0.2573, 0.87], ["making", 0.2624, 0.8501, 0.2928, 0.87], ["adjustments.", 0.2979, 0.8501, 0.3602, 0.87], ["Disconnect", 0.0932, 0.8654, 0.1449, 0.8873], ["selector", 0.1489, 0.8654, 0.1869, 0.8873], ["rod", 0.1905, 0.8654, 0.2062, 0.8873], ["(1)", 0.2107, 0.8687, 0.2239, 0.8813], ["on", 0.228, 0.8654, 0.2381, 0.8873], ["selector", 0.2421, 0.8654, 0.2786, 0.8873], ["lever", 0.2837